,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-01-09T20:05:30Z","updated_at":"2026-01-19T20:53:28Z","closed_at":"2026-01-19T20:52:25Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in v4.4.1.stable.mono.official [49a5bc7b6]\n\n### System information\n\nmacOS 15.6.1\n\n### Issue description\n\n<img width=\"576\" height=\"352\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a1b0de56-d380-42d8-bddb-8903ce345316\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nI've copy/pasted this script from the minimal repro that I've attached:\n\n```cs\nusing Godot;\n\npublic partial class Main : Control\n{\n    private TabContainer _tabContainer = null!;\n\n    public override void _Ready()\n    {\n        GetTree().Root.ContentScaleFactor = 2; // note: this is unnecessary for the repro, but it makes it easier to see the UI on a high-DPI display\n        _tabContainer = GetNode<TabContainer>(\"%InnerTabContainer\");\n        for (int i = 0; i < _tabContainer.GetTabCount(); i++)\n        {\n            _tabContainer.SetTabHidden(i, true);\n        }\n\n        Button button = GetNode<Button>(\"%Button\");\n        button.Pressed += ShowTabContainerAndTabs;\n\n        _tabContainer.SetTabHidden(1, false);\n        _tabContainer.GetTabBar().CurrentTab = 1;\n        _tabContainer.SetTabHidden(2, false);\n        _tabContainer.GetTabBar().CurrentTab = 2;\n    }\n\n    private void ShowTabContainerAndTabs()\n    {\n        _tabContainer.Show();\n    }\n}\n```\n\nYou just have to click the button in the repro to get this to happen.\n\nNote that this does _not_ happen if you change this block:\n\n```cs\n        _tabContainer.SetTabHidden(1, false);\n        _tabContainer.GetTabBar().CurrentTab = 1;\n        _tabContainer.SetTabHidden(2, false);\n        _tabContainer.GetTabBar().CurrentTab = 2;\n```\n\n...to this:\n\n```cs\n        _tabContainer.SetTabHidden(0, false);\n        _tabContainer.GetTabBar().CurrentTab = 0;\n        _tabContainer.SetTabHidden(2, false);\n        _tabContainer.GetTabBar().CurrentTab = 2;\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[TabBar_repro.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24534787/TabBar_repro.zip)\n\n### Workaround\n\nIf anyone else is encountering this issue, you can do this inside `VisibilityChanged` to work around it:\n\n- Set `GetTabBar().ClipTabs = false;`\n- Wait for a frame (`await node.ToSignal(node.GetTree(), SceneTree.SignalName.ProcessFrame);`)\n- Set `GetTabBar().ClipTabs = true;`","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114809/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114809/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}